---
---
<section class="relative w-full" style="background:#1A0F0A;">
  <div class="relative h-[88vh] min-h-[600px] overflow-hidden">
    <img src="/images/cafe-torref/hero.webp" alt="Grains de café fraîchement torréfiés" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80" fetchpriority="high"/>
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(26,15,10,0.55) 0%, rgba(26,15,10,0.20) 100%);"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center">
      <div class="max-w-content mx-auto w-full px-6 md:px-14">
        <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] mb-5" style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; color:#B57A4A;">Lot · #2026/04 · torréfié il y a 6 jours</div>
        <h1 class="font-instrument text-6xl md:text-8xl leading-[0.95] max-w-3xl" style="color:#E8DDC7;">
          <em class="italic">Du grain vert</em><br/>au noir parfait,<br/><em class="italic" style="color:#B57A4A;">douze minutes.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color:#D8C9A8;">
          Brûlerie artisanale. Quatre origines, deux courbes de torréfaction, vente directe en grains et moulu. Tout est traçable au lot, daté au jour.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="#abonnement" class="inline-flex items-center h-12 px-7 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-semibold" style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; background:#B57A4A; color:#1A0F0A;">Abonnement café · 14€</a>
          <a href="#origines" class="inline-flex items-center h-12 px-7 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-semibold border" style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; border-color:#E8DDC7; color:#E8DDC7;">Voir les origines</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
